{"3183430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "7 Nights Keeper", "steam_appid": 3183430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183430/extras/93e6c6aeca7eaf3dd0ce03e0611f3551.webp?t=1787805837\" width=185 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO TALES OF TERROR. ONE SINISTER TRUTH </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Experience two colliding nightmares in a gritty, PSX-style survival horror. Play through two seemingly disconnected storylines that slowly bleed into one terrifying revelation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amaan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You needed the money, so you took the job: watch an isolated mansion for seven nights. The catch? The owner’s grandmother is locked inside, possessed by a volatile, malevolent demon. Manage her escalating outbursts, survive the supernatural dread, and make it to sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daniel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miles away in the freezing woods lies the abandoned Sector 4 Logging Camp. Armed with a classified dossier, you must navigate pitch-black dirt roads and rusted freight elevators to uncover the grim truth behind the Ashen Crown syndicate—before you become their next cargo. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183430/extras/3856a14564a926e8f7a435a83175c1cd.poster.avif?t=1787805837\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183430/extras/3856a14564a926e8f7a435a83175c1cd.webm?t=1787805837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183430/extras/3856a14564a926e8f7a435a83175c1cd.mp4?t=1787805837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration, driving, minigames and conversation mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Psychological Horror </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and photo-realistic graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >House caretaker simulator</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange characters that may help you in your journey</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183430/extras/93e6c6aeca7eaf3dd0ce03e0611f3551.webp?t=1787805837\" width=185 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO TALES OF TERROR. ONE SINISTER TRUTH </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Experience two colliding nightmares in a gritty, PSX-style survival horror. Play through two seemingly disconnected storylines that slowly bleed into one terrifying revelation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amaan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You needed the money, so you took the job: watch an isolated mansion for seven nights. The catch? The owner’s grandmother is locked inside, possessed by a volatile, malevolent demon. Manage her escalating outbursts, survive the supernatural dread, and make it to sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daniel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miles away in the freezing woods lies the abandoned Sector 4 Logging Camp. Armed with a classified dossier, you must navigate pitch-black dirt roads and rusted freight elevators to uncover the grim truth behind the Ashen Crown syndicate—before you become their next cargo. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183430/extras/3856a14564a926e8f7a435a83175c1cd.poster.avif?t=1787805837\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183430/extras/3856a14564a926e8f7a435a83175c1cd.webm?t=1787805837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183430/extras/3856a14564a926e8f7a435a83175c1cd.mp4?t=1787805837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration, driving, minigames and conversation mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Psychological Horror </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and photo-realistic graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >House caretaker simulator</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange characters that may help you in your journey</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "7 NIGHTS KEEPER is a PS1-inspired psychological horror game following two interconnected stories: a desperate housekeeper trapped inside a decaying mansion, and a detective investigating a child kidnapping tied to the estate’s dark past.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183430/e79dbce899abdc8d5de8e67a26883755215ad1fb/header.jpg?t=1787805837", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183430/b86bd23a437acf